    "body": "For [`client`](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request-client) in particular, I believe it'll be the [relevant settings object](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#realms-settings-objects-global-objects) of the [`Document`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#document) passed into https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom/#fetch-a-css-style-sheet. Once you set the client, I believe you won't need to set the origin anymore, since the client provides a default for the origin. (This comment isn't intended to replace the need for the spec to explain how to set the client.)",
